            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Note: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>- To be eligible, a </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8' underline='true'>minimum of 100% target</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'> attainment is required</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>- Points based system for activations (A=10, B=7, C=5, D=1, Ungraded=1) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>-</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>When the country is </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Hong Kong</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'> or </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Finland</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>, the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Opportunity Business Type</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'> exception has been expanded to include </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Legal Form Change</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'> and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Owner Change</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>, alongside the existing types </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>New Business</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'> and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>Win Back</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>. </run>
            </formatted-text>
